 \"stream\":\"<symbol>@depthSnapshot\" and \"generated\":true.\n\nDuring data collection, integrity of incremental order book updates is validated using sequence numbers from the real-time feed (pu and u fields). If a missed message is detected, the WebSocket connection is restarted. Initial book snapshots fetched from REST API are also validated for overlap with received depth messages.","frequency":"on-subscribe","frequencySource":"internal","generated":true,"sourceFor":["book_change"],"availableSince":"2019-11-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"name":"bookTicker","description":"Best bid and best ask updates stream","frequency":"real-time","frequencySource":"exchange-docs","exchangeDocsUrl":"https://developers.binance.com/docs/derivatives/usds-margined-futures/websocket-market-streams/Individual-Symbol-Book-Ticker-Streams","sourceFor":["book_ticker"],"availableSince":"2019-11-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"name":"forceOrder","description":"Liquidation order stream publishing only the latest liquidation per symbol in each 1000ms window","frequency":"1s","frequencySource":"exchange-docs","exchangeDocsUrl":"https://developers.binance.com/docs/derivatives/usds-margined-futures/websocket-market-streams/Liquidation-Order-Streams","availableSince":"2020-01-07T00:00:00.000Z","sourceFor":["liquidation"]},{"name":"ticker","description":"24h futures ticker updates stream","frequency":"2s","frequencySource":"exchange-docs","exchangeDocsUrl":"https://developers.binance.com/docs/derivatives/usds-margined-futures/websocket-market-streams/Individual-Symbol-Ticker-Streams","sourceFor":["derivative_ticker"],"availableSince":"2019-11-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"name":"markPrice","description":"Mark price and funding metrics stream","additionalInfo":"Subscribed as @markPrice@1s.","frequency":"1s","frequencySource":"exchange-docs","exchangeDocsUrl":"https://developers.binance.com/docs/derivatives/usds-margined-futures/websocket-market-streams/Mark-Price-Stream","sourceFor":["derivative_ticker"],"changes":[{"until":"2020-02-13T00:00:00.000Z","frequency":"3s"}],"availableSince":"2019-11-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"name":"premiumIndex","description":"Generated premium index snapshots stream","additionalInfo":"Snapshots are fetched from the REST premium index endpoint about every 6 seconds for all instruments. The recorder emits one generated message per instrument, marked as \"stream\":\"<symbol>@premiumIndex\" and \"generated\":true with REST response format. This channel includes the interestRate field that is not present on the WebSocket markPrice stream.","frequency":"6s","frequencySource":"internal","exchangeDocsUrl":"https://developers.binance.com/docs/derivatives/usds-margined-futures/market-data/rest-api/Mark-Price","availableSince":"2026-04-11T00:00:00.000Z","generated":true},{"name":"indexConstituents","description":"Generated index price constituents snapshots stream","additionalInfo":"Snapshots are fetched from the REST index price constituents endpoint every minute per supported instrument. Messages are marked as \"stream\":\"<symbol>@indexConstituents\" and \"generated\":true with REST response format.","frequency":"1m","frequencySource":"internal","exchangeDocsUrl":"https://developers.binance.com/docs/derivatives/usds-margined-futures/market-data/rest-api/Index-Constituents","availableSince":"2026-04-23T00:00:00.000Z","generated":true},{"name":"openInterest","description":"Generated open interest snapshots stream","additionalInfo":"Snapshots are fetched from the REST open interest endpoint about every 6 seconds per instrument. Messages are marked as \"stream\":\"<symbol>@openInterest\" and \"generated\":true with REST response format.","frequency":"6s","frequencySource":"internal","availableSince":"2020-05-12T00:00:00.000Z","generated":true,"sourceFor":["derivative_ticker"]},{"name":"fundingInfo","description":"Generated funding info snapshots stream","additionalInfo":"Snapshots are fetched from the REST funding info endpoint every minute. Binance returns only symbols wi